WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.607
Measuring random fractal curves exactly.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.627
These random curves are fractals, too wiggly for ordinary length.

3
00:00:06.777 --> 00:00:10.105
Schramm asked which exact measuring rule gives them a true length.

4
00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:14.552
Claimed: a power with an iterated log correction.

5
00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:18.153
Lean covers only the positive half.
